  "body": "A number of the reported Prometheus metrics are duplicated. This can be a problem for Prometheus instances configured to monitor a large number of Synapse instances.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n * we have two copies of each counter, one with and one without a `_total` suffix\r\n * `synapse_util_caches_cache:hits` is duplicated as `synapse_util_caches_cache_hits`.\r\n\r\n",
